  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Linear Gauge control is used to display data along a linear scale, either horizontally or vertically. It supports multiple axes, multiple pointers (bar, marker), ranges, gradient fills, tooltips, annotations, and animation. Common use cases include thermometers, progress indicators, ruler-style KPIs, and measurement instruments. It is highly customizable and accessible, making it a versatile gauge control for dashboards and industrial monitoring applications built on ASP.NET Core.",
